          <svg width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 13.065l-11.985-8.065v16h23.97v-16zm11.985-9.065h-23.97l11.985 8.065z"/></svg>
          abrahamvilchesdelacruz@gmail.com
